Date: Tue, 21 Apr 2026 10:02:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 06/10] Add fetch-based REST client

URL building with encoded queries, per-attempt timeouts, retries with
exponential backoff for 429/502/503/504 and network errors, and
ApiError mapping.
